  (text "ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8I\n\nINDUSTRIAL Temperature Range: -40C to +85C\n\nWiFi: 802.11 b/g/n (2.4GHz, onboard PCB antenna)\nBLE: v5.0, LE Coded PHY\nFlash: 16MB (Quad SPI)\nPSRAM: 8MB (Octal SPI)\nCPU: Dual Xtensa LX7 @ 240MHz\n\nNOTE: Commercial variant (no I suffix) = 0C to +85C only.\nFor outdoor weather stations ALWAYS use the -I variant."
    (at 190.5 140.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
  )

  (text "GPIO PIN MAP\n─────────────────────────────────────────\nGPIO0   = BOOT button (active low)\nGPIO2   = Status LED (green, active high)\nGPIO4   = Wind Speed (interrupt, 10k pull-up)\nGPIO5   = Rain Gauge (interrupt, 10k pull-up)\nGPIO6   = Battery ADC (100k/100k divider)\nGPIO7   = Industry ADC (soil moisture / pyranometer)\nGPIO8   = I2C SDA (4.7k pull-up)\nGPIO9   = I2C SCL (4.7k pull-up)\nGPIO10  = SPI MOSI (LoRa)\nGPIO11  = SPI MISO (LoRa)\nGPIO12  = SPI SCK (LoRa)\nGPIO13  = LoRa CS\nGPIO14  = LoRa RESET\nGPIO15  = LoRa DIO0 (interrupt)\nGPIO16  = 1-Wire Bus A (soil temp / panel temp front)\nGPIO17  = Leaf Wetness ADC\nGPIO18  = Deep Soil Moisture ADC\nGPIO19  = 1-Wire Bus B (panel temp back) / USB D-\nGPIO20  = Power Meter Pulse / USB D+\nGPIO43  = UART TX\nGPIO44  = UART RX"
    (at 340.36 60.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
  )

  (text "IMPORTANT: GPIO19/GPIO20 are shared between\nUSB and Solar industry module.\nDo not use USB while Solar feature is active.\nFor production: use UART for programming."
